 "root_cause": {
  "field": "use_cache",
  "_the_only_differing_field": "Recovered from CONTENT, not inferred from a hash. Three Phase-A state configs retained in the out-of-tree store were produced by this same operator machinery; diffing each against a reconstruction of its own geometry leaves exactly one differing key, `use_cache` (real false, reconstruction true). One of those real configs hashes to f69c2fb3a120\u2026, which is the value attempt 3 recorded for three of the five selected leaves.",
  "mechanism": "`DepthCausalKLGreedyV1.apply` sets `model.config.use_cache = False` on the PARENT MODEL OBJECT, because `bypassed_blocks` cannot work with a layer-indexed KV cache. `build_config` copies the parent's dict, so every descendant inherits it. The SEARCH reused ONE teacher model object across all 108 expansions, so the first causal-KL DEPTH expansion flipped the shared teacher to False and every later expansion \u2014 of any path, with any first operator \u2014 started from a contaminated root. The REPLAY loads a fresh teacher per path and the hub config says `use_cache: true`.",
  "why_two_paths_still_matched": "d005dfb2 begins with causal-KL DEPTH, which sets the flag False at step 0 regardless of the root, so it reproduces from either root. 7da1e4e2 begins with ATTENTION and was expanded BEFORE any DEPTH expansion had contaminated the shared teacher, so attempt 3 recorded it with `use_cache: true` \u2014 which is exactly what a fresh load gives. Both matched on the pod.",
  "why_the_other_three_cannot": "1d2844488f3a, 88086555a666 and 1a2b5b030e7e begin with FFN, positional DEPTH and WIDTH respectively. None of those three mutates the flag, and all three were expanded after the shared teacher had been contaminated, so attempt 3 recorded them with `use_cache: false` while a fresh-teacher replay produces `true`. They diverge at step 0, before any operator arithmetic.",
  "not_the_cause": [
   "the host NVIDIA driver difference (580.126.09 vs 580.159.03) \u2014 the weights were byte-identical across it",
   "numerics or a near-degenerate ranking \u2014 the kept_neurons selection was identical across all 36 layers",
   "the transformers 4-to-5 rope_theta/rope_parameters migration \u2014 both runs ran 5.13.1 and ATTENTION-first reproduces exactly"
  ]
 },
